#. column 7: ALIASES:<br>　/egiglamour, /egiglam, /petglamour<br>USAGE:<br>　/egiglamour [summon] [glamour]<br><br>→Alter the appearance of select summons. You must resummon the egi for the glamour to take effect. Command not applicable in PvP instances.<br><br>>>Summon Name:<br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Carbuncle</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Garuda-Egi</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Titan-Egi</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Ifrit-Egi</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Eos</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>>>Glamour:<br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Carbuncle</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Emerald Carbuncle</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Topaz Carbuncle</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Ruby Carbuncle</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Garuda-Egi</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Titan-Egi</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Ifrit-Egi</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Selene</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>The glamour will be removed when no glamour is specified.<br>Displays pet glamour settings in chat log when no subcommand is specified.<br><br>>>Example:<br>　/egiglamour "Garuda-Egi" "Ruby Carbuncle"<br>　(Garuda-Egi will appear glamoured as Ruby Carbuncle.)<br>　/petglamour "Garuda-Egi"<br>　(Returns Garuda-Egi to default appearance.)<br>　/petglamour<br>　(Displays pet glamour settings.)
#. column 8: /egiglamour
