msgid "USAGE: <br>　/autofacetarget [subcommand]<br><br>→Automatically face target when using action.<br><br>>>Subcommands:<br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>on </ui-edge-color></ui-color>       Enable auto-face.<br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>off </ui-edge-color></ui-color>       Disable auto-face.<br><br>Toggle between on/off when no subcommand is specified."
