msgid "ALIASES:<br>　/autosheathe, /asheathe<br>USAGE:<br>　/autosheathe [subcommand]<br><br>→Auto-sheathe weapon when not in battle.<br><br>>>Subcommands:<br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>on </ui-edge-color></ui-color>      Enable auto-sheathe.<br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>off </ui-edge-color></ui-color>      Disable auto-sheathe.<br><br>Toggle between on/off when no subcommand is specified."
