msgid "USAGE:<br>　/groundclick [subcommand]<br><br>→Enable clicking on field to remove target.<br><br>>>Subcommands:<br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>on </ui-edge-color></ui-color>      Enable ground clicking.<br>　<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>off </ui-edge-color></ui-color>      Disable ground clicking.<br><br>Toggle between on/off when no subcommand is specified."
